    """Reduce a list of base classes to its ordered minimum equivalent.

    This function returns a list containing only the most derived classes
    from the original ``classes`` iterable.  A class is omitted when there is
    another class in the input list that is a subclass of it.  Duplicate
    classes are removed while preserving the original order of the first
    occurrence.

